### 오래된 순 — 첫 페이지
# @name oldest
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3

### 최신순 — 첫 페이지
# @name newest
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?order=newest&limit=3

### 최신순 — 둘째 페이지
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?order=newest&limit=3&cursor={{newest.nextCursor}}

### 오래된 순 — 둘째 페이지
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?limit=3&cursor={{oldest.nextCursor}}

### 최신순에 오래된 순의 커서를 보내면
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?order=newest&limit=3&cursor={{oldest.nextCursor}}

### 정렬 값이 틀리면
GET http://localhost:4001/api/products/1/reviews?order=popular
